1
00:01:52,776 --> 00:01:54,411
Kept me waiting, huh?

2
00:01:54,845 --> 00:01:56,280
Had to take care of something.

3
00:01:56,713 --> 00:01:58,315
Now, hand over the goods.

4
00:02:11,929 --> 00:02:13,230
Right? Aren't they great?

5
00:02:13,430 --> 00:02:14,598
Yeah! Yeah!

6
00:02:15,065 --> 00:02:18,735
-But why did we have to do it here? -Welcome, welcome!

7
00:02:18,936 --> 00:02:20,137
I've no other choice.

8
00:02:20,337 --> 00:02:22,573
If my wife found out, I'd be done for.

9
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:24,575
Oh, I see.

10
00:02:25,642 --> 00:02:28,245
Hey, Nakagawa, I'll show you something good. Come here.

11
00:02:28,445 --> 00:02:29,179
Huh?

12
00:02:30,047 --> 00:02:31,648
What do you mean?

13
00:02:31,882 --> 00:02:32,983
Take a look.

14
00:02:33,517 --> 00:02:35,319
No, no! Don't show me that!

15
00:02:36,186 --> 00:02:38,322
Are you not interested in women?

16
00:02:38,522 --> 00:02:39,823
By any chance, are you...?

17
00:02:40,257 --> 00:02:42,626
I'm just... on duty right now.

18
00:02:42,826 --> 00:02:45,329
And it's not right to look at that in a police station.

19
00:02:45,529 --> 00:02:46,897
So uptight. That's suspicious.

20
00:02:47,097 --> 00:02:48,265
Yeah, suspicious.

21
00:02:48,465 --> 00:02:49,766
N-No, it's not!

22
00:02:49,967 --> 00:02:51,335
What are you guys doing?

23
00:02:52,002 --> 00:02:56,206
Oh, Katsuta-san. You brought more dirty books and videos, huh?

24
00:02:56,440 --> 00:02:59,276
N-No. I was just passing by...

25
00:02:59,776 --> 00:03:03,747
Kei-chan, if you get involved with these guys, you'll never turn out right.

26
00:03:04,214 --> 00:03:05,315
Shut up!

27
00:03:05,516 --> 00:03:09,219
Katsuta, let's talk about the future of Japanese politics in the back room.

28
00:03:09,853 --> 00:03:10,988
Yeah.

29
00:03:12,156 --> 00:03:14,491
Nakagawa, let me know if the chief comes.

30
00:03:14,691 --> 00:03:15,359
Okay.

31
00:03:17,227 --> 00:03:19,763
What on earth is he thinking?

32
00:03:23,500 --> 00:03:24,501
Hey, good job.

33
00:03:24,701 --> 00:03:25,969
Welcome back, sir.

34
00:03:26,470 --> 00:03:27,771
Oh? Where's Ryotsu?

35
00:03:27,971 --> 00:03:28,705
Oh, um...

36
00:03:28,939 --> 00:03:30,707
I thought he wasn't off duty today.

37
00:03:31,141 --> 00:03:33,777
Ryo-chan is in the back looking at something dirty.

38
00:03:34,511 --> 00:03:35,512
What?

39
00:03:37,114 --> 00:03:39,516
Heh... smooth skin and a nice body, huh?

40
00:03:39,983 --> 00:03:41,184
This one's a blonde.

41
00:03:41,385 --> 00:03:42,653
Mmm... very nice!

42
00:03:42,853 --> 00:03:44,521
Hey!

43
00:03:45,255 --> 00:03:47,190
Oh, Ch-Chief! You're here!

44
00:03:48,692 --> 00:03:49,660
Nakagawa...

45
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:52,563
Ryotsu, show me what you've hidden behind your back.

46
00:03:52,896 --> 00:03:55,499
Oh, it's nothing special!

47
00:03:55,699 --> 00:03:57,067
-Right? -Y-Yes.

48
00:03:57,534 --> 00:04:00,070
You said, "smooth skin and a nice body," right?

49
00:04:00,837 --> 00:04:03,340
Uh, they're photos of sumo wrestlers.

50
00:04:03,540 --> 00:04:05,075
They're not interesting.

51
00:04:05,542 --> 00:04:08,979
Oh, sumo wrestlers! I'd love to see them.

52
00:04:09,179 --> 00:04:11,548
Idiot! The chief is a huge sumo fan.

53
00:04:12,349 --> 00:04:16,086
Oh, they're out of focus. Not something worth showing you.

54
00:04:16,553 --> 00:04:18,221
Just show me!

55
00:04:19,022 --> 00:04:19,690
Hey!

56
00:04:20,224 --> 00:04:20,924
Come on!

57
00:04:21,692 --> 00:04:24,528
Now, let me see them!

58
00:04:24,728 --> 00:04:25,362
Hey!

59
00:04:26,530 --> 00:04:28,298
Give it up!

60
00:04:32,436 --> 00:04:33,270
Oh!

61
00:04:34,037 --> 00:04:36,006
Hey! Spit them out!

62
00:04:38,175 --> 00:04:39,610
Now there's no evidence.

63
00:04:39,843 --> 00:04:41,612
Y-You jerk!

64
00:04:42,279 --> 00:04:46,450
If I catch you red-handed again, you'll be fired at once, so be prepared!

65
00:04:46,650 --> 00:04:47,618
Okay, okay.

66
00:04:48,452 --> 00:04:49,386
Phew.

67
00:04:49,853 --> 00:04:54,625
Damn! They were precious original photos! I spent all my money on them!

68
00:04:54,891 --> 00:04:57,628
It's stupid to pay for something like that.

69
00:04:57,961 --> 00:04:58,929
Shut up!

70
00:04:59,129 --> 00:05:01,298
Hey, give me some replacement photos.

71
00:05:01,498 --> 00:05:03,500
No, I can't. You don't have any money, do you?

72
00:05:03,734 --> 00:05:05,502
Those ones cost money too.

73
00:05:05,736 --> 00:05:07,471
I'm begging you.

74
00:05:07,871 --> 00:05:08,639
Come on!

75
00:05:09,306 --> 00:05:10,507
-Oh, yes! -Please.

76
00:05:10,741 --> 00:05:11,642
Well...

77
00:05:11,875 --> 00:05:14,278
I might share some with you depending on the situation.

78
00:05:14,478 --> 00:05:15,412
Really?

79
00:05:15,612 --> 00:05:17,614
-Well then... -Hmm...

80
00:05:18,415 --> 00:05:21,985
Oh, come on! That's a piece of cake.

81
00:05:25,122 --> 00:05:27,257
Ryo-san, Ryo-san. I brought those photos.

82
00:05:27,924 --> 00:05:29,760
Today, I put them in this.

83
00:05:30,227 --> 00:05:31,962
You're so smart.

84
00:05:32,162 --> 00:05:34,464
Yeah, perfect camouflage.

85
00:05:34,665 --> 00:05:38,802
Today's are amazing. Super dirty photos of hot gals.

86
00:05:39,002 --> 00:05:40,170
I can't wait to see them.

87
00:05:40,370 --> 00:05:41,772
So, as promised...

88
00:05:41,972 --> 00:05:43,106
I know.

89
00:05:43,306 --> 00:05:44,841
-Here. -Oh!

90
00:05:45,075 --> 00:05:48,945
These are photos from when we all went to the beach last summer.

91
00:05:50,113 --> 00:05:54,351
I'd just bought an underwater camera and took photos at the beach and in the bath.

92
00:05:54,551 --> 00:05:57,187
Nice photos. Collectors would love them.

93
00:05:57,854 --> 00:06:00,390
Some have some unwanted extras in them, though.

94
00:06:01,091 --> 00:06:05,028
But does anyone really want photos like these?

95
00:06:05,262 --> 00:06:06,663
There are fans of this stuff.

96
00:06:06,863 --> 00:06:09,199
Hmph! I don't get it at all.

97
00:06:10,167 --> 00:06:15,005
Come on! Bringing such dirty photos to the workplace is sexual harassment.

98
00:06:15,205 --> 00:06:17,407
Hey, give them back! Those are different!

99
00:06:17,641 --> 00:06:18,508
What?

100
00:06:19,343 --> 00:06:20,677
Oh! What in the world?

101
00:06:20,877 --> 00:06:22,879
Hey! What are these photos?

102
00:06:23,380 --> 00:06:24,815
Well, they're just...

103
00:06:25,015 --> 00:06:26,717
I didn't know that was what you liked.

104
00:06:26,950 --> 00:06:28,051
Ryotsu...

105
00:06:28,285 --> 00:06:29,419
No! I...

106
00:06:29,653 --> 00:06:31,888
You're still as noisy as ever.

107
00:06:32,489 --> 00:06:33,390
Oh! Chief!

108
00:06:33,757 --> 00:06:35,892
What's up? You're off duty.

109
00:06:36,393 --> 00:06:40,130
I'm going to Nagoya to see my old boss who's retired.

110
00:06:40,330 --> 00:06:43,133
But I forgot something, so I stopped by to pick it up.

111
00:06:43,333 --> 00:06:44,901
Oh, here it is.

112
00:06:46,670 --> 00:06:49,072
By the way, it looked like you were arguing.

113
00:06:49,306 --> 00:06:51,375
No, there was no argument.

114
00:06:51,575 --> 00:06:52,442
Right, Nakagawa?

115
00:06:52,676 --> 00:06:53,410
R-Right.

116
00:06:54,010 --> 00:06:58,515
You're not bringing any shady stuff into the police station again, are you?

117
00:06:58,715 --> 00:06:59,916
No way!

118
00:07:00,150 --> 00:07:02,419
Anyway, you're going to miss your train...

119
00:07:03,053 --> 00:07:06,056
Oh, no. The bullet train leaves at exactly 12 o'clock.

120
00:07:06,256 --> 00:07:07,758
Well then, I'm off.

121
00:07:07,991 --> 00:07:08,725
Have a nice trip!

122
00:07:08,925 --> 00:07:10,260
Take care!

123
00:07:11,194 --> 00:07:14,264
Jeez, he gave me a fright.

124
00:07:14,464 --> 00:07:16,867
Well, let's have a look now.

125
00:07:17,067 --> 00:07:20,437
But first, I want my photos back.

126
00:07:20,871 --> 00:07:23,373
Huh? This is all that's in here.

127
00:07:24,007 --> 00:07:26,243
Where did you put my photos?

128
00:07:26,443 --> 00:07:30,046
What? That's weird. I'm sure I put them in here.

129
00:07:30,881 --> 00:07:35,285
Ryo-san, I don't remember wrapping those erotic photos in paper like this.

130
00:07:35,485 --> 00:07:36,586
Eh? What?

131
00:07:41,291 --> 00:07:42,559
Huh?! What's this?

132
00:07:45,262 --> 00:07:46,296
What's going on?

133
00:07:46,897 --> 00:07:50,434
Come to think of it, the chief was carrying a paper bag just like that one.

134
00:07:50,634 --> 00:07:51,301
What?

135
00:07:51,835 --> 00:07:54,805
If the chief's bag is still here...

136
00:07:55,138 --> 00:07:58,375
That means he took mine by mistake!

137
00:08:02,045 --> 00:08:02,746
Damn!

138
00:08:02,946 --> 00:08:05,849
He'll already be at the station and on the train by now.

139
00:08:06,283 --> 00:08:08,485
Nakagawa! Get your car now!

140
00:08:09,119 --> 00:08:11,788
What? Why do I have to go?

141
00:08:11,988 --> 00:08:15,425
Do you want the chief to see those photos?

142
00:08:16,460 --> 00:08:21,498
Some idiot cop put his nude photos in a women's weekly magazine,

143
00:08:21,832 --> 00:08:23,233
and I'm sure he got fired.

144
00:08:23,433 --> 00:08:24,267
What?

145
00:08:25,168 --> 00:08:26,236
I'm going to...

146
00:08:29,339 --> 00:08:30,340
get fired?

147
00:08:32,809 --> 00:08:36,246
Go after the chief! We'll catch him at Tokyo Station!

148
00:08:36,546 --> 00:08:37,547
Go!

149
00:08:43,653 --> 00:08:44,621
Ryotsu!

150
00:08:44,821 --> 00:08:46,723
It's dangerous. Please sit down.

151
00:08:51,328 --> 00:08:52,562
Floor it! Floor it!

152
00:08:53,663 --> 00:08:57,534
It's all right. At this pace, I think we'll be able to get ahead somehow.

153
00:08:57,901 --> 00:08:58,735
Oh!

154
00:09:00,804 --> 00:09:01,538
What is it?

155
00:09:07,344 --> 00:09:09,513
What the heck? Damn it!

156
00:09:16,820 --> 00:09:19,055
Ryotsu, please sit down and fasten your seat belt.

157
00:09:19,289 --> 00:09:20,323
Okay.

158
00:09:22,926 --> 00:09:23,994
What are you gonna do?!

159
00:09:24,194 --> 00:09:25,328
We're breaking through!

160
00:09:42,779 --> 00:09:45,081
"TOKYO STATION"

161
00:09:45,482 --> 00:09:50,153
&lt;i&gt;The Hikari 707 bound for Hakata will be departing shortly at 12:00.&lt;/i&gt;

162
00:09:51,621 --> 00:09:53,957
Where's the 707? 707...

163
00:09:57,227 --> 00:10:00,497
He has a sweet tooth, so I'm sure he'll like these.

164
00:10:01,331 --> 00:10:02,265
Where is it? Where?

165
00:10:02,499 --> 00:10:05,502
Ryotsu! The platform is over there. This way!

166
00:10:09,773 --> 00:10:10,740
&lt;i&gt;The doors are closing.&lt;/i&gt;

167
00:10:13,376 --> 00:10:16,746
Oh no! Where is he? Where's the chief?

168
00:10:28,725 --> 00:10:29,593
Damn it!

169
00:10:29,793 --> 00:10:32,729
Nakagawa, let's drive ahead to the next station.

170
00:10:32,929 --> 00:10:34,464
That train goes straight to Nagoya.

171
00:10:34,831 --> 00:10:35,799
W-What?

172
00:10:36,266 --> 00:10:39,836
And even my Cobra couldn't make it to Nagoya in two hours.

173
00:10:40,070 --> 00:10:42,839
What do we do? If he sees what's in the bag,

174
00:10:43,073 --> 00:10:44,808
I'm totally fired!

175
00:10:45,575 --> 00:10:48,078
Is there nothing we can do now? We're fired!

176
00:10:48,278 --> 00:10:51,781
To catch up with a bullet train moving at 200 kilometers per hour...

177
00:10:55,285 --> 00:10:57,487
Ryotsu, there's still a way.

178
00:10:58,254 --> 00:10:59,622
Quit the empty words!

179
00:10:59,823 --> 00:11:02,792
If even your Cobra's too slow, how the heck could we catch up?

180
00:11:03,927 --> 00:11:04,794
A jet helicopter.

181
00:11:05,261 --> 00:11:05,996
Oh!

182
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:12,102
Hey! It's not coming yet?

183
00:11:12,302 --> 00:11:15,005
That's strange. It should be here already...

184
00:11:16,673 --> 00:11:17,507
Ah, there it is!

185
00:11:22,145 --> 00:11:23,513
Whoa!

186
00:11:30,186 --> 00:11:31,121
What the...?

187
00:11:36,359 --> 00:11:38,528
What's that scary-looking helicopter?

188
00:11:38,728 --> 00:11:42,799
It's the Mil MI-24 Hind, a Soviet armed military helicopter.

189
00:12:02,218 --> 00:12:03,820
You idiot!

190
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:07,891
We're gonna chase him with a military chopper? That'll stand out!

191
00:12:08,091 --> 00:12:10,060
All the jet helicopters were in use,

192
00:12:10,293 --> 00:12:13,329
and this was the only thing that could come within 30 minutes.

193
00:12:13,530 --> 00:12:15,231
Well, at least disarm it!

194
00:12:15,465 --> 00:12:16,833
We might get shot down!

195
00:12:17,500 --> 00:12:19,369
There's no time for that.

196
00:12:19,569 --> 00:12:21,838
Do you want the train to arrive in Nagoya?

197
00:12:23,006 --> 00:12:24,541
I don't want that.

198
00:12:26,009 --> 00:12:27,210
Well, whatever!

199
00:12:27,410 --> 00:12:28,745
&lt;i&gt;The bullet train is in sight.&lt;/i&gt;

200
00:12:28,945 --> 00:12:29,579
What?

201
00:12:29,779 --> 00:12:31,481
Nakagawa, open the door!

202
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:39,189
That's the Hikari 707!

203
00:12:39,389 --> 00:12:41,091
Bring the helicopter closer!

204
00:12:51,868 --> 00:12:53,436
Hey! What's that?

205
00:12:53,670 --> 00:12:55,672
The helicopter's so close!

206
00:12:59,609 --> 00:13:00,610
Where's the chief?

207
00:13:00,977 --> 00:13:02,112
Where is he?

208
00:13:04,714 --> 00:13:05,448
There he is!

209
00:13:05,982 --> 00:13:07,117
I found the chief!

210
00:13:15,959 --> 00:13:17,127
All right, we're ready.

211
00:13:18,094 --> 00:13:19,295
Let's go!

212
00:13:19,629 --> 00:13:21,464
Huh? Now?

213
00:13:21,798 --> 00:13:24,234
There are lots of tunnels here. It's too dangerous!

214
00:13:24,434 --> 00:13:26,603
If we don't hurry, the train will reach Nagoya.

215
00:13:26,803 --> 00:13:28,138
I need to talk to the pilot.

216
00:13:28,371 --> 00:13:29,739
Ah, Ryotsu!

217
00:13:35,111 --> 00:13:36,479
What are you thinking?

218
00:13:36,713 --> 00:13:38,581
We're gonna jump from the left wing,

219
00:13:38,782 --> 00:13:41,317
so lower the altitude to 15 meters above the ground!

220
00:13:42,852 --> 00:13:44,754
Please watch out for the power lines!

221
00:13:52,195 --> 00:13:54,497
Okay. Find the right time,

222
00:13:54,731 --> 00:13:56,599
and jump between the power lines.

223
00:13:56,800 --> 00:13:57,467
Got it!

224
00:13:58,101 --> 00:14:00,470
&lt;i&gt;There's a tunnel ahead! Hurry!&lt;/i&gt;

225
00:14:01,037 --> 00:14:02,172
Are you ready?

226
00:14:02,405 --> 00:14:03,106
Yeah!

227
00:14:03,306 --> 00:14:04,474
Okay, let's go!

228
00:14:04,974 --> 00:14:06,042
&lt;i&gt;We have no time!&lt;/i&gt;

229
00:14:06,442 --> 00:14:08,111
Ready, go!

230
00:14:09,512 --> 00:14:10,346
This is the limit!

231
00:14:15,652 --> 00:14:16,519
Did they make it?

232
00:14:16,753 --> 00:14:19,155
Yes. It looks like they managed to jump safely.

233
00:14:21,858 --> 00:14:22,859
Are you okay, Ryotsu?

234
00:14:23,059 --> 00:14:23,827
Y-Yeah.

235
00:14:24,027 --> 00:14:26,863
But what a noise! It's deafening!

236
00:14:43,913 --> 00:14:45,849
Okay, I'm in.

237
00:14:51,321 --> 00:14:53,990
This is exciting, like 007.

238
00:14:54,190 --> 00:14:55,225
Yeah, but...

239
00:14:55,458 --> 00:14:58,394
It's a pathetic mission to get back some erotic photos.

240
00:15:12,408 --> 00:15:13,743
There he is.

241
00:15:14,644 --> 00:15:16,412
He's sleeping. This is our chance.

242
00:15:16,813 --> 00:15:17,513
I'll go.

243
00:15:25,555 --> 00:15:26,956
There it is! That one!

244
00:15:27,590 --> 00:15:29,859
Just keep sleeping.

245
00:15:30,260 --> 00:15:31,761
I'll switch them while I can.

246
00:15:43,439 --> 00:15:44,207
Hmm?

247
00:15:45,408 --> 00:15:47,277
Oh, I fell asleep.

248
00:15:47,710 --> 00:15:49,979
Excuse me? What's wrong?

249
00:15:50,980 --> 00:15:52,782
Nothing, never mind...

250
00:15:57,320 --> 00:15:58,855
Oh, that was close.

251
00:15:59,055 --> 00:16:01,224
If he sees your face, it's all over.

252
00:16:04,861 --> 00:16:06,763
Getting close to Shizuoka.

253
00:16:06,963 --> 00:16:08,598
I must have slept a lot.

254
00:16:08,931 --> 00:16:10,967
Time for a bathroom break.

255
00:16:11,701 --> 00:16:14,003
He's getting up. This is my chance!

256
00:16:16,306 --> 00:16:17,707
Oh, right.

257
00:16:17,907 --> 00:16:19,976
I should call him.

258
00:16:20,176 --> 00:16:21,577
Where's my planner?

259
00:16:21,778 --> 00:16:23,146
Oh, here it is.

260
00:16:23,646 --> 00:16:24,914
Hold on.

261
00:16:25,114 --> 00:16:27,750
I'd better take my wallet after all.

262
00:16:29,319 --> 00:16:30,453
This time for sure!

263
00:16:30,987 --> 00:16:32,188
Oh, right!

264
00:16:32,655 --> 00:16:34,991
No, it's okay.

265
00:16:35,191 --> 00:16:36,159
On second thought...

266
00:16:37,460 --> 00:16:40,663
I'll bring the gift just in case.

267
00:16:41,297 --> 00:16:44,133
Um, are you really okay?

268
00:16:44,334 --> 00:16:46,169
Yes, don't worry...

269
00:16:53,776 --> 00:16:56,379
The timing's all wrong.

270
00:16:56,612 --> 00:16:58,014
Time for plan B.

271
00:16:58,214 --> 00:16:59,515
A bento and a beer, please.

272
00:16:59,749 --> 00:17:02,118
Okay, one bento and one beer.

273
00:17:03,586 --> 00:17:04,821
This could work!

274
00:17:05,221 --> 00:17:06,456
Nakagawa.

275
00:17:09,058 --> 00:17:10,660
Huh?! No way!

276
00:17:10,860 --> 00:17:12,462
Oh, yeah?

277
00:17:12,662 --> 00:17:14,063
You'd rather get fired?

278
00:17:14,297 --> 00:17:15,798
W-Well...

279
00:17:16,699 --> 00:17:18,301
Hey, you there.

280
00:17:20,937 --> 00:17:22,605
I've got a favor to ask.

281
00:17:22,805 --> 00:17:23,873
Would you help me?

282
00:17:24,507 --> 00:17:26,209
Y-Yes!

283
00:17:34,317 --> 00:17:37,220
Would anyone like a bento and a beer?

284
00:17:38,855 --> 00:17:41,657
&lt;i&gt;The newspaper is blocking his view. This is my chance!&lt;/i&gt;

285
00:17:55,705 --> 00:17:58,875
Your face isn't great, but you've got a nice ass, lady.

286
00:17:59,075 --> 00:18:00,343
What are you doing?!

287
00:18:00,676 --> 00:18:01,511
Oh?

288
00:18:03,513 --> 00:18:05,581
Grandpa, sexual harassment isn't okay.

289
00:18:05,815 --> 00:18:08,584
It's not like they'll wear out. Come on, give me a feel.

290
00:18:08,818 --> 00:18:10,386
These are...

291
00:18:10,853 --> 00:18:11,554
Rustle, rustle?

292
00:18:11,754 --> 00:18:13,189
-Enough already! -Hey!

293
00:18:13,389 --> 00:18:14,590
What the heck are you doing?

294
00:18:15,258 --> 00:18:17,994
Hey, you! No violence against the elderly.

295
00:18:18,194 --> 00:18:20,897
Huh? I feel like I've seen you somewhere before...

296
00:18:21,097 --> 00:18:22,365
Y-You must be mistaken.

297
00:18:22,565 --> 00:18:24,233
Oh, that's right.

298
00:18:24,434 --> 00:18:27,370
People say I look like the one on the right in Puffy.

299
00:18:27,570 --> 00:18:29,605
No, maybe someone I know...

300
00:18:29,839 --> 00:18:31,073
Hey, you.

301
00:18:32,041 --> 00:18:33,109
How much is this?

302
00:18:33,309 --> 00:18:34,744
Oh, no, that's not for sale!

303
00:18:34,944 --> 00:18:35,912
That voice is...

304
00:18:36,379 --> 00:18:38,147
Not for sale? What do you mean?

305
00:18:38,381 --> 00:18:40,883
It's right here, so it must be for sale, right?

306
00:18:41,084 --> 00:18:41,751
N-No, well...

307
00:18:41,951 --> 00:18:44,420
So? Are you selling it or not? How much?

308
00:18:44,787 --> 00:18:47,623
All right, all right. I'll sell it. 100 yen.

309
00:18:49,025 --> 00:18:51,627
What? You sold it?

310
00:18:51,961 --> 00:18:53,696
I had no choice.

311
00:18:53,896 --> 00:18:55,498
I was about to get caught any second.

312
00:18:55,731 --> 00:18:58,935
Damn that old man! Always getting in the way!

313
00:18:59,135 --> 00:19:01,137
Cross-dressing was never going to work.

314
00:19:01,337 --> 00:19:02,138
Hmm...

315
00:19:02,905 --> 00:19:04,874
Okay. I'll go this time.

316
00:19:05,074 --> 00:19:06,642
It's gonna be close combat.

317
00:19:10,046 --> 00:19:12,982
Hamamatsu already? About half an hour to go.

318
00:19:13,182 --> 00:19:14,650
Excuse me.

319
00:19:15,351 --> 00:19:18,087
Uh, is the seat next to you free?

320
00:19:18,287 --> 00:19:19,155
Yes, go ahead.

321
00:19:20,656 --> 00:19:23,326
I'm Mr. Kato, a 10th-generation Japanese-American.

322
00:19:23,526 --> 00:19:26,162
Nice to meet you.

323
00:19:26,896 --> 00:19:27,797
Hmm?

324
00:19:27,997 --> 00:19:29,131
Something wrong?

325
00:19:29,332 --> 00:19:30,666
Have we met somewhere before?

326
00:19:30,900 --> 00:19:33,202
Oh! This is the first time. Really!

327
00:19:33,436 --> 00:19:36,506
Oh! Hamassie, the monster of Lake Hamana!

328
00:19:36,939 --> 00:19:38,808
Oh, no. It was a giant eel.

329
00:19:39,008 --> 00:19:41,010
I just remembered I have urgent business.

330
00:19:41,210 --> 00:19:43,346
Uh, I'm very busy.

331
00:19:45,114 --> 00:19:46,616
Excuse me, sir.

332
00:19:46,816 --> 00:19:49,185
May I see your ticket?

333
00:19:49,986 --> 00:19:50,953
Ticket?

334
00:19:51,153 --> 00:19:53,222
You mean... chicken?

335
00:19:53,456 --> 00:19:54,624
No, ticket.

336
00:19:54,824 --> 00:19:56,859
Oh, you mean cricket?

337
00:19:57,093 --> 00:19:58,194
Still wrong.

338
00:19:58,394 --> 00:19:59,795
-Kick it? -Sir!

339
00:19:59,996 --> 00:20:00,630
Woof woof!

340
00:20:00,830 --> 00:20:02,165
That doesn't even rhyme.

341
00:20:02,565 --> 00:20:03,299
Oh!

342
00:20:03,833 --> 00:20:05,535
Hey! Where's my paper bag?

343
00:20:07,203 --> 00:20:08,504
You did it, Ryotsu!

344
00:20:08,704 --> 00:20:10,206
Idiot! Let's get out of here!

345
00:20:10,406 --> 00:20:11,307
What?

346
00:20:11,941 --> 00:20:13,676
-Get back here! -Hey! Stop!

347
00:20:16,312 --> 00:20:19,248
-Hold it! Stop right there! -Give me back my bag!

348
00:20:19,482 --> 00:20:20,983
-Stop! -Hey, thief!

349
00:20:21,250 --> 00:20:23,986
No way we're getting caught now, damn it!

350
00:20:29,825 --> 00:20:30,860
Get back here!

351
00:20:36,132 --> 00:20:37,600
Hurry up, lady!

352
00:20:37,833 --> 00:20:39,402
We can't get through!

353
00:20:39,602 --> 00:20:42,572
Excuse me! Are you implying I'm fat?

354
00:20:42,805 --> 00:20:44,073
-Besides, you guys... -My gift!

355
00:20:44,273 --> 00:20:45,341
Hey!

356
00:20:46,075 --> 00:20:47,143
Oh no!

357
00:20:48,578 --> 00:20:50,146
Eek! What are you doing?

358
00:20:52,848 --> 00:20:53,816
Sorry!

359
00:20:56,052 --> 00:20:56,686
Oh!

360
00:20:57,353 --> 00:20:58,621
My gift.

361
00:20:59,522 --> 00:21:04,160
I'm still sure I've seen those guys before. Hmm...

362
00:21:07,530 --> 00:21:08,364
Oh!

363
00:21:18,608 --> 00:21:21,210
Come on, give up!

364
00:21:21,410 --> 00:21:22,745
-Nakagawa! -Yes!

365
00:21:27,316 --> 00:21:28,484
W-What's this?

366
00:21:34,624 --> 00:21:36,192
-Uh, huh? -Hey, hey!

367
00:21:45,301 --> 00:21:46,569
Hold it!

368
00:21:50,072 --> 00:21:50,906
Okay.

369
00:21:51,674 --> 00:21:52,608
Got them!

370
00:21:53,309 --> 00:21:54,043
Here, Ryotsu.

371
00:21:54,243 --> 00:21:56,112
Ah, my erotic photos!

372
00:21:57,246 --> 00:21:59,915
Operation complete. Move in and retrieve us now.

373
00:22:00,449 --> 00:22:03,919
&lt;i&gt;Sir, the bullet train is now traveling at top speed.&lt;/i&gt;

374
00:22:04,120 --> 00:22:05,254
&lt;i&gt;It's too dangerous.&lt;/i&gt;

375
00:22:06,455 --> 00:22:09,759
If we waste time, we'll enter Toyohashi City.

376
00:22:09,959 --> 00:22:12,261
Yeah. It'll cause a big commotion.

377
00:22:12,461 --> 00:22:14,330
We have no choice! Use the last resort!

378
00:22:14,530 --> 00:22:15,364
&lt;i&gt;Roger!&lt;/i&gt;

379
00:22:15,598 --> 00:22:18,134
Last resort? What are they gonna do?

380
00:22:18,334 --> 00:22:19,935
Just watch.

381
00:22:26,008 --> 00:22:27,343
No way! They fired!

382
00:22:34,150 --> 00:22:35,351
What's that smoke?

383
00:22:35,551 --> 00:22:36,552
B-Brake!

384
00:22:41,791 --> 00:22:42,658
I see.

385
00:22:42,858 --> 00:22:44,093
Now, here it comes.

386
00:22:53,402 --> 00:22:56,806
I've finally got the erotic photos back.

387
00:22:57,006 --> 00:22:58,541
Ryotsu, it's dangerous here.

388
00:22:58,741 --> 00:23:00,209
Let's get back in the chopper now.

389
00:23:00,409 --> 00:23:01,043
Yeah!

390
00:23:06,515 --> 00:23:09,151
Phew. That was way too close.

391
00:23:11,387 --> 00:23:13,055
Hey, wait! No way!

392
00:23:22,665 --> 00:23:27,503
Argh! My photos! Nooo!

393
00:23:31,006 --> 00:23:32,241
They dropped some papers.

394
00:23:32,441 --> 00:23:33,909
Is it some kind of ad?

395
00:23:34,143 --> 00:23:35,144
Leaflets?

396
00:23:38,247 --> 00:23:40,516
What a mess...

397
00:23:41,050 --> 00:23:42,618
Just some thrill-seeker, I guess.

398
00:23:42,852 --> 00:23:46,021
Yeah, they committed such a vile act

399
00:23:46,222 --> 00:23:48,791
just to get in the papers.

400
00:23:49,024 --> 00:23:52,461
Honestly, what an absolute idiot.

401
00:23:52,695 --> 00:23:55,798
I don't think he did it for fun though.

402
00:23:56,465 --> 00:23:57,433
Jeez...

403
00:24:03,038 --> 00:24:08,811
A BANQUET TO DIE FOR
